@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/use-case-diagram
hide footbox
participant "System(UC4)" as UC4
participant System

UC4 -> System : 1. Evaluates badge criteria
System -> System : 1.1 Checks if user met new thresholds

alt Threshold met : True
    System -> System: 1.2 Assigns new Badge to User
    System --> UC4: return success & notify  user
else Threshold met : False
System --> UC4: return no action
end

@enduml